    {"from": "editorial.c", "to": "artifacts.c", "kind": "cites", "reason": "The sanitized prompt trail becomes the spine that can organize slides, docs, prototypes, code, and raw material."},
    {"from": "artifacts.c", "to": "multiplayer.c", "kind": "cites", "reason": "Portable artifact bundles are what make exploratory AI work shareable, forkable, and useful to collaborators."}
